      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "vague"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The community lies along Pennsylvania Route 928, about 6.4 miles south-southwest of McConnellsburg.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10,
        19
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Big_Cove_Tannery%2C_Pennsylvania",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The name comes from the expansive Big Cove valley, a basin surrounded by the Kittochting and Tuscarora mountains.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        30
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/big_cove_tannery_pennsylvania",
      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Scotch‑Irish settlers first arrived in the mid‑1700s, staking claims around 1730‑1740 despite Native American control until 1754.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/big_cove_tannery_pennsylvania",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "In 2017, a stretch of Big Cove Creek near the town was chosen as one of 14 Keystone Select Stocked Trout Waters, stocked with 14‑ to 20‑inch trout.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
